Usage: /workspace/6g-agent-audit/upstream/6G-Testbed/aitestbed/run_full_tests.sh [OPTIONS]

Matrix source: configs/scenarios.yaml:test_matrix

Options:
  --quick        Run 3 iterations per scenario with shorter delays
  --full         Run 30 iterations per scenario
  --runs N       Set exact number of runs per scenario
  --stress       Enable stress tests (burst search, parallel benchmark)
  --no-capture   Disable L3/L4 packet capture (enabled by default)
  --no-anonymize Disable database anonymization (enabled by default)
  --no-clean     Keep existing database and pcaps (default: clean start)
  --resume       Resume from last successful run (implies --no-clean);
                 reports now aggregate the entire cycle, not just this leg.
  --add-runs N   Append N more runs of every scenario/profile to the existing
                 cycle. Implies --no-clean. Mutually exclusive with --resume.
  --verbose, -v  Show full output instead of progress bar
  --enable LIST  Only run these phases (comma-separated)
  --disable LIST Skip these phases (comma-separated)

Phase names for --enable/--disable:
  chat, realtime, image, search, deepseek, gemini, music,
  trading, computer_use, playwright, multimodal, google_search, stress,
  vllm, openclaw, a2a

Environment variables:
  RUNS_PER_SCENARIO        Number of runs (default: 10)
  INTER_SCENARIO_DELAY     Seconds between scenarios (default: 2)
  INTER_PROVIDER_DELAY     Seconds between providers (default: 5)
  CAPTURE_PCAP             Enable pcap capture (default: true)
  CAPTURE_DIR              Pcap output directory (default: results/captures)
  CAPTURE_FILTER           BPF filter (default: HTTP(S) plus WebRTC ICE/SRTP/RTP UDP ports)
  ANONYMIZE_DB             Anonymize provider/model names (default: true)
  CLEAN_START              Archive old data before starting (default: true)
  NETWORK_INTERFACE        Global interface override (default: auto)
  RUN_TIMEOUT_SEC          Per-run timeout in seconds (default: 600, 0 = no timeout)
  TRACE_PAYLOADS           Persist redacted payload traces (default: 0)

Optional API keys (for additional scenarios):
  GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY    Enable Google search scenarios
  GOOGLE_SEARCH_CX         Required with GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY
  SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID        Enable Spotify music agent scenarios
  SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET    Required with SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID

Pipeline (automated after tests):
  1. Generate charts (latency, TTFT, throughput, heatmaps, pcap analysis)
  2. Export to Excel (15 sheets)
  3. Generate RESULTS.md (full evaluation report)
  4. Generate TRACES.md (sample request/response traces)
  5. Build ML dataset from pcap captures
  6. Train MLP traffic classifier + k-sweep
  7. Train CVAE traffic generator
  8. Generate synthetic traffic traces
  9. Evaluate synthetic traffic quality (KS tests)
 10. Anonymize database

